# {{ artifact.name }}

This is the pruned model of `{{ master.repo }}` ({{ artifact.n_routed | int }} of {{ artifact.n_routed_base | int }} routed experts, keep-set `{{ keepset.A.sha256 | short }}`) with its routed experts in NVFP4.

**The repack is lossless.**
- Every expert keeps its packed E2M1 bytes.
- Each MXFP4 power-of-two block scale becomes two exact float8_e4m3 block scales.
- A per-tensor FP32 global scale carries the remaining exponent.

Every tensor was checked: there are no underflowing blocks, and the dequantized values match the source exactly.

**Healing.** The global scales of `w2` also carry the per-layer heal gain, which is exact because every block scale stays a power of two. The gain was measured by router replay on the final keep-set. It is {{ heal.status }}; the per-layer gains are in `reap_keepset.json`.

**Input scales.** These are per expert: activation amax divided by six times four hundred forty-eight. The amax was measured on the pruned model's own activations, and for `w2` it is the un-gated input.

The dense path stays in the base FP8 block format.

**Loader compatibility** with vLLM's mixed FP8 + NVFP4 MoE path has **not** been verified by us. This checkpoint does not fit our target device; see `hf_quant_config.json`.

